      <description>&lt;p&gt;ដើម្បីធ្វើការ Bypass ទៅលើ UAC នៅរាល់ប្រព័ន្ធប្រតិបត្តិការវីនដូជំនាន់ថ្មី (៨/១០/១១) យើងអាចប្រើប្រាស់ឯកសារ PS1 ដើម្បីបង្កើតចេញជា &lt;a&#xA;    href=&#34;https://github.com/stephenfewer/ReflectiveDLLInjection&#34;target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;    class=&#34;inline-flex items-center gap-1&#34;&#xA;  &gt;dll reflection&lt;svg class=&#34;h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0&#34; id=&#34;external-link&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; d=&#34;M15 3h6v6m-11 5L21 3m-3 10v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt; ដែលអាច Exploit តាមរយៈឯកសារដើម cmstp.exe នៃប្រព័ន្ធគោលពីរ។&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 id=&#34;c-dll-reflection-code&#34;&gt;C# DLL Reflection Code&lt;a href=&#34;#c-dll-reflection-code&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link to this section&#34;&gt;&lt;svg class=&#34;h-4 w-4&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;g fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;div&#xA;  class=&#34;code-block-container border-border bg-card my-6 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border shadow-sm transition-all duration-200 ease-out hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-md&#34;&#xA;  data-code-block&#xA;  data-code-id=&#34;code-0&#34;&#xA;  data-collapsible=&#34;true&#34;&#xA;  data-default-state=&#34;expanded&#34;&#xA;  data-collapsed=&#34;false&#34;&#xA;  data-auto-collapse-lines=&#34;30&#34;&#xA;  data-auto-collapse-height=&#34;400&#34;&#xA;  data-collapsed-hei